  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EastMed Year 9 Scientific and Institutional Cooperation to Support Responsible Fisheries in the EM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective 1
Strengthen national and sub-regional capacity (administration, stakeholders, research institutions) for a proper implementation of the ecosystem approach to fisheries (EAF) including the identification of fisheries management strategies at national level. 
Objective 2
Improve capacity for fisheries monitoring, research and the preparation of scientific advice for fisheries management.
Objective 3
Enhance regional cooperation and coordination in support of fisheries management, research, and capacity development.</narrative>
  </description>
